<br/><br/>This item includes PS VR content. PlayStation VR and PlayStation Camera are required to experience these features.<br/><br/>VR games may cause some players to experience motion sickness."},{"__typename":"Description","type":"LONG","value":"Cytus Selection Vol.2 song pack contains the following:<br/>・Future World<br/>    - TV Mode difficulty: Easy 4 / Normal 6 / Hard 8<br/>    - VR Mode difficulty: Easy 4 / Hard 8<br/>・Holy Knight<br/>    - TV Mode difficulty: Easy 3 / Normal 7 / Hard 10<br/>    - VR Mode difficulty: Easy 3 / Hard 9<br/>・Niflheimr<br/>    - TV Mode difficulty: Easy 2 / Normal 7 / Hard 10<br/>    - VR Mode difficulty: Easy 2 / Hard 10<br/>・Parousia<br/>    - TV Mode difficulty: Easy 4 / Normal 8 / Hard 10<br/>    - VR Mode difficulty: Easy 5 / Hard 10<br/>・Recollections<br/>    - TV Mode difficulty: Easy 3 / Normal 7 / Hard 9<br/>    - VR Mode difficulty: Easy 5 / Hard 9<br/>"},{"__typename":"Description","type":"COMPATIBILITY_NOTICE","value":"PS VR headset enabled<br/>PS Camera optional<br/>PS Move motion controller required<br/>2 PS Move motion controllers supported<br/>1 players<br/>DUALSHOCK 4 vibration"},{"__typename":"Description","type":"LEGAL","value":"<br><br>Download of this product is subject to the PlayStation Terms of Service and our Software Usage Terms plus any specific additional conditions applying to this product. If you do not wish to accept these terms, do not download this product. See Terms of Service for more important information.<br>"},{"__typename":"Description","type":"LEGAL","value":"<br>One-time licence fee to download to multiple PS4 systems. Sign in to PlayStation is not required to use this on your primary PS4, but is required for use on other PS4 systems.<br>"},{"__typename":"Description","type":"LEGAL","value":"<br>See <a href=\"https://www.playstation.com/legal/health-warning/\">Health Warnings</a> for important health information before using this product.<br>"},{"__typename":"Description","type":"LEGAL","